      "role_hint": "project and local setup documentation",
      "lines": {
        "1": "# Demo authentication service",
        "2": "",
        "3": "This small FastAPI app issues a signed session token after a username and password are verified.",
        "4": "The demo login is `ada` / `demo-password`.",
        "5": "",
        "6": "## Local setup",
        "7": "",
        "8": "1. Create a Python 3.11 virtual environment.",
        "9": "2. Install dependencies with `pip install -r requirements.txt`.",
        "10": "3. Set `SESSION_SECRET` in the environment.",
        "11": "4. Start the app with `uvicorn app.routes:app --reload`.",
        "12": "5. Run tests with `pytest`.",
        "13": "",
        "14": "The demo uses an in-memory user table in `app/db.py`; replace it with a real data store for production work."
      },
